WEBVTT

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:23.790
Your initials I wrote in my notebook

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:31.600
Discreetly overlapping so they won't be noticed

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.110
I stretched up

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:42.110
The school building I looked up at and the distant sky

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:53.690
The moon in broad daylight shows some restraint and lingers inside the light.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:01:01.310
I want these feelings to reach you

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:59.520
my heart

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:11.500
I embrace the small bud of passion that sprouted in my heart

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:13.880
I close my eyes

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:18.170
Some day I want to make it bloom into a big flower

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:15.750
someday

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:26.940
Our fluttering hearts connected, our eyes exchanging a glance

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:13.440
Christmas Eve is coming in two days.

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:16.460
It's already been a year, huh?

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:19.670
Time goes by so quickly.

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:32.450
Thank you very much.

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:36.260
Welco-

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:37.760
Teratani.

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:41.510
Looks like you're getting pretty used to your job.

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:50.450
Have you already decided which college to try for?

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:52.940
I picked three colleges including backups.

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:55.380
I can't fail the exam twice.

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:57.570
I've got to pass next year, no matter what.

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:00.950
Refreshing water "Fuwarin!"

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:04.950
It refreshes your heart and soul!

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:08.700
Fuwarin.

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:11.600
Yoshizuki really is amazing, isn't she?

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:15.710
This one commercial made all the guys in Japan crazy about her.

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:21.300
Hey, have you even talked to her recently?

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:24.220
Not really. Her next play starts soon,

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:27.320
so she's busy doing magazine interviews and other stuff.

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:28.080
Well,

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.860
she was selected as the co-star out of nowhere, you know?

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:33.900
How can you be so patient?

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.940
I want Iori-chan's dream to come true.

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:41.640
It's been a while, but she's coming over tonight.

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:45.240
No wonder your room is so clean!

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:46.990
Oh, hey!

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:49.370
Spotted.

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:52.840
You're finally going to put the moves on her.

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:55.540
I'm being prepared, just in case.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.950
Really though, you're pretty incredible.

00:03:57.950 --> 00:04:01.010
To be able to wait so long for Yoshizuki's sake.

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:04.490
If I were you, I would have given up on her and found another girl.

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:07.880
I guess you really do feel that strongly about her.

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:09.520
Teratani...

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:13.270
Well, I'll head home.

00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:18.570
I'm looking forward to hearing your report!

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:34.910
Iori-chan's pretty late...

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:39.290
Hello!

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:41.290
I'm sorry, Seto-kun.

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:43.720
They still haven't given me the okay to leave rehearsal,

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.040
so I don't think I'll be able to make it over today.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:48.590
Uh... I see.

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:51.670
Oh, don't worry about me.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:54.480
Good luck with your rehearsal.

00:04:55.380 --> 00:04:56.160
Thank you.

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.470
Iori! What are you doing?

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:03.580
Isai-sensei is waiting for you.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:05.090
Oh, yes!

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:15.730
We haven't seen each other in over a month.

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:20.180
See you tomorrow!

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:29.290
Hello!

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:31.070
Oh, Yoshizuki.

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:32.710
I just finished my part time job.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.390
What? Something came up?

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:39.440
I have to discuss the play, with Isai-san.

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:43.610
He's a very busy person, and he told me that he's only free for today.

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:47.700
But we planned today's date two weeks ago.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.390
You've been so busy rehearsing all the time...

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:51.480
...I couldn't even get through to you on the phone.

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:53.620
And for that, I'm genuinely sorry.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:56.000
Are you sure you can't make it?

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:59.170
I promise I'll make time for you soon.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:02.470
Then, can we meet just for a while? Just for one hour.

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:04.930
Please don't get me in trouble.

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:06.880
I really want to see you!

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:09.370
Seto-kun...

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:12.530
I'll wait for you. Five o'clock at our usual park.

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:15.100
I really want to see you too, you know?

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:20.310
Is that true? Why don't you prove it to me?

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:22.270
Huh?

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:42.460
Huh, Ichitaka?

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:45.620
Aren't you supposed to have a date with Yoshizuki today?

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:47.670
She cancelled at the last minute.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:50.830
She said she has something to discuss with her dear director, Isai-san.

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:53.050
You're not fighting, are you?

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:57.060
I yelled at her saying that's not fair!

00:06:57.060 --> 00:07:00.060
I guess that wasn't her, then.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:05.300
I just saw a girl in the park that looked like Yoshizuki.

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:12.360
Hey! Ichitaka!

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:35.990
Yoshizuki...

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:42.350
Well, I...

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:47.450
I'm sorry. I didn't think you'd actually come.

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:55.200
I guess we really don't match, do we?

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:58.850
To tell you the truth,

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:01.390
I've been in a slump lately, with my rehearsals.

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:03.800
My role is very difficult,

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:06.540
and Isai-san has yells at me almost every day.

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:09.610
I'm always asking you to be patient with me, too.

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:11.330
Just what am I doing?

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:15.110
Then, what you were trying to discuss with Isai-san was...?

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:19.170
I was planning to quit.

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:24.800
But I know I can't quit under these circumstances.

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:26.490
I'm just being selfish.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:29.660
I don't even like <i>myself</i> very much right now,

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:34.300
so I can understand if you've run out of patience.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:36.410
Yoshizuki...

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:40.620
What am I supposed to do?

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.040
Hello.

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:02.550
It's been a long time. I'm Furukawa, Iori's manager.

00:09:03.610 --> 00:09:06.310
There's something I want to discuss with you.

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:19.490
Welcome! I've been waiting.

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:26.420
We're having an open rehearsal for the mass media today.

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:49.390
You idiot! What the hell are you doing Yoshizuki?!

00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:50.950
I'm sorry, sir!

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:54.040
If you aren't serious, why don't you leave now?!

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:55.530
Can I do it one more time?

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:57.670
Who the heck does he think he is?!

00:09:58.210 --> 00:10:00.280
The more talented they are, the more he yells at them.

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:06.290
There you go.

00:10:06.990 --> 00:10:09.990
Um. What exactly did you want to discuss?

00:10:09.990 --> 00:10:13.690
Let me speak frankly. We want you to break up with Iori.

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:16.970
She's a golden egg,

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:20.270
and you are an obstacle in her way.

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:23.410
Don't you mean I'm in <i>your</i> way, not hers?

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:25.640
Don't you care if you destroy her dream?

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:27.670
I don't have any intention of doing that!

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:30.150
Just how much do you love her?

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:35.450
Would you die for her?

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:37.420
I'd die for her.

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:39.800
Then, break up with her.

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:43.630
You're preventing her from realising her talent.

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:44.710
No.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:49.210
If you'd die for her, then you can kill your feelings.

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.280
Even if I agree...

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:53.530
She won't, will she?

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:54.760
If you dumped her,

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:57.680
she'd be so hurt and she wouldn't be able to act.

00:10:57.680 --> 00:10:58.220
Then-

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:02.590
Don't worry. The pain will only make her stronger.

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:03.720
What?

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:06.390
We've got two weeks until the play debuts.

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:11.430
In that time, I can heal her and get her prepared to go on.

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:14.050
It would be best if you broke up with her now.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:18.010
Die... for her sake.

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:26.100
Oh, I'm really tired.

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:27.600
Me too!

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:34.170
Seto-kun!

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:38.440
You surprised me!

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:40.260
What are you doing here?

00:11:49.990 --> 00:11:52.720
Yoshizuki, I came here to tell you something.

00:11:52.720 --> 00:11:53.810
What is it?

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:56.620
I really don't think I can take this any more.

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:59.370
You're my girlfriend, and yet we can't even have fun together.

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:00.130
What?

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:04.530
Besides, I'm getting closer to a girl I met at my part time job.

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:08.700
So, to tell you the truth, I want you to stop calling me.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:11.320
Seto-kun?

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:14.860
I'm sorry, but I want to break up.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:17.580
You idiot! Why the hell would you say something like that?

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:19.840
Even saying the wrong thing has its limits!

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:23.360
I'm going to talk to Yoshizuki!

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:26.890
I'll tell her everything that Isai's people told you!

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:29.450
It's all right, Teratani.

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:33.940
I don't want to destroy Iori-chan's talent or dream either.

00:13:33.940 --> 00:13:36.200
What about your feelings?

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:39.260
The feelings that you love Yoshizuki!

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:42.090
I'll just keep those in my heart.

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:48.720
I'll always keep my feelings for Iori-chan in my heart.

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:52.960
What are you talking about?

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:54.570
Trying to act all cool.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.870
Can I talk to you guys?

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:59.390
What is it?

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:01.820
I found a pretty worrying site on the net.

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.710
The Marionette King?

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:09.490
What is this?

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:12.750
This is...

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:15.140
That's all just bull!

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:18.370
It's just another deluded idiot on the net.

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:21.340
I hope so too.

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:24.670
Hey, Ichitaka!

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:31.780
You do <i>get</i> that you broke up with Yoshizuki, right?

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:33.060
Yeah.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:36.050
You'll never go see her again, ever?

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:36.950
Yeah.

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:40.250
Then why are you trying to guard her?

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:42.490
I'm just going to keep an eye out for her from afar.

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:45.030
I won't show myself in front of her.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:48.500
What kind of an idiot are you?

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:51.620
She won't even realise what you're doing.

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:54.410
Ichitaka!

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:39.290
There's really no saving an idiot like you.

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:44.290
Teratani...

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:46.100
Don't worry.

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:48.510
She's going to be holed up in Isai-san's office...

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:50.670
...until the opening day of the play.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.930
Go home tonight and get a good night's rest.

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:56.180
Thank you, Teratani.

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:58.770
You know, this is the first time I've seen you like this.

00:15:59.340 --> 00:16:02.890
I've never seen you go so far for Yoshizuki's sake.

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:07.520
Well, if you've come this far, you might as well see it through to the end.

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:10.170
Though, I'm not sure if you're doing it wrong or just reckless.

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:14.700
And the day after tomorrow, on Christmas Eve,

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:20.380
Yoshizuki's appearing on FM live to promote her play.

00:16:20.380 --> 00:16:21.500
Iori-chan's going to be on the radio?

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:24.320
I saw it on the web page of her theatre group.

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:26.970
If the Marionette King were to attack her,

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:29.130
it'd most likely be that day, when she shows up in public.

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:52.940
Today's guest is...

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:56.690
...an up-and-coming talent, who's currently rising in popularity,

00:16:56.690 --> 00:16:59.340
Yoshizuki Iori-chan!

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:36.400
You're the Marionette King?!

00:17:40.190 --> 00:17:42.160
Do you want to buy the video tape?

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:45.460
Then give me 100,000 yen.

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:54.790
You're annoying!

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:56.680
Why don't you sleep for a while?

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:08.630
What? Are you high on something?

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:10.810
You're the one who's high!

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:17.320
That voice... I've heard that voice before...

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:22.740
And it really ticks me off!

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:35.920
Iori! You're my doll!

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:38.900
I won't let you go!

00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:39.680
What are you doing?!

00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:47.570
Iori! Come over here!

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:50.550
Iori, what are you doing? Hurry up!

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:12.220
The last train is gone now.

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:17.720
Seto-kun, don't worry about me.

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:19.810
I can't just let you go.

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:23.990
It's my fault that you couldn't get off the train at your stop.

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:26.370
I'll make sure to take you home.

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:29.840
It's become a pretty unforgettable Christmas Eve.

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:30.980
I guess so.

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:38.150
Yoshizuki.

00:19:47.250 --> 00:19:48.290
Thank you.

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:19.480
We did a preliminary exam on him, but there doesn't seem to be anything wrong.

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:21.110
The cause is unknown.

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:24.520
Sensei, is my son going to be all right?

00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:26.190
I'm not sure yet.

00:20:26.190 --> 00:20:29.120
But this coma has lasted too long,

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.830
so to be honest, we can't let our guard down.

00:20:32.610 --> 00:20:33.620
Ichitaka...

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:37.680
Isn't it bad that he hasn't regained consciousness?

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:40.090
He's been dreaming continuously.

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:42.060
The nurse said so.

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:44.140
Something about his brainwaves...

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:46.140
Teratani, where are you going?

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:47.680
Where do you think?

00:20:51.090 --> 00:20:53.070
Teratani, are you?!

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:55.100
I'm going to go get Yoshizuki!

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:59.980
Yoshizuki is the one Ichitaka would want at his side the most right now.

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:02.640
But the play starts today...

00:21:02.640 --> 00:21:04.320
I know that!

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.930
I know that,

00:21:07.610 --> 00:21:09.580
but at this rate, Ichitaka will...

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:14.910
Nami?

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:19.420
I think the security might not be so tight for a woman.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:30.430
What's the deal?

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:33.510
They're treating us like criminals.

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:36.390
I knew it would have been better if it was just Yuka and I.

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:38.430
What's that supposed to mean?

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:42.150
Nami! Yuka!

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:43.760
Teratani-kun, too!

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:45.400
You all came to the show!

00:21:47.680 --> 00:21:49.290
What's wrong, everybody?

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:53.990
Iori, can you come with us for like an hour?

00:21:53.990 --> 00:21:56.160
What? No, I can't.

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:58.660
We've got the final meeting and preparation.

00:21:58.660 --> 00:22:01.540
Come with us for just an hour!

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:04.210
Ichitaka is in trouble! He might even die!

00:22:05.060 --> 00:22:07.790
It's time. We have to go now.

00:22:07.790 --> 00:22:11.600
Wait! I'm serious! He's in trouble!

00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:11.600
Get out of here!

00:22:12.010 --> 00:22:14.350
He protected you, Iori!

00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:19.290
While you were being cheered by your fans at the radio station yesterday,

00:22:19.290 --> 00:22:21.080
he was fighting alone to protect you!

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:23.790
That's when he hit his head and lost consciousness!

00:22:23.790 --> 00:22:25.570
He's still in a coma!

00:22:25.570 --> 00:22:27.240
Yesterday?

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:29.490
Oh, that drug addict?

00:22:30.680 --> 00:22:32.630
That was a good job,

00:22:32.630 --> 00:22:35.080
but in the end, it was our bodyguards that subdued him.

00:22:35.430 --> 00:22:38.430
That's what you'd call a meaningless effort.

00:22:39.380 --> 00:22:41.840
You old hag! Why are you so cruel?!

00:22:41.840 --> 00:22:43.430
Old hag?!

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:45.960
Iori, let's go!

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:50.800
Iori?

00:22:50.800 --> 00:22:52.720
Yoshizuki, listen to me!

00:22:52.720 --> 00:22:56.390
Even now, Ichitaka loves you more than anything!

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:58.560
He didn't want to break up with you,

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:00.380
but those guys made him do it!

00:23:00.380 --> 00:23:03.520
He was only thinking of you! He couldn't help it!

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:05.570
This is how much he sacrificed!

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:06.710
Just an hour!

00:23:06.710 --> 00:23:10.120
Can't you give him just one hour of you time?!

00:23:10.120 --> 00:23:13.160
Iori, Seto-kun is dreaming now.

00:23:13.680 --> 00:23:16.100
He's probably dreaming of you.

00:23:16.100 --> 00:23:17.750
That's why he won't wake up.

00:23:18.430 --> 00:23:22.310
Because, even if he returns to reality, you won't be there with him.

00:23:22.310 --> 00:23:26.150
His dream is to be happy together with you.

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:30.410
He doesn't want to come back to a world without you.

00:23:31.190 --> 00:23:32.390
So, please!

00:23:32.870 --> 00:23:34.890
Please help him!

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:38.380
This time it's your turn to help Seto-kun!

00:23:39.380 --> 00:23:41.900
I'm sorry... everyone...

00:23:41.900 --> 00:23:42.820
Yoshizuki!

00:23:42.820 --> 00:23:43.330
Iori!

00:23:43.330 --> 00:23:45.400
Iori! Wait a minute!

00:23:43.750 --> 00:23:45.400
Yoshizuki!

00:23:47.490 --> 00:23:49.900
I'm really disappointed in Yoshizuki.

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:51.790
She can't help it.

00:23:51.790 --> 00:23:54.990
Iori's living in a different world to us, now.

00:23:55.660 --> 00:23:57.000
Ichitaka!

00:24:03.440 --> 00:24:06.500
What's wrong?! Is he in danger?

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:08.020
No, it's not that.

00:24:08.750 --> 00:24:11.570
Shall I put it on a speaker phone?

00:24:11.570 --> 00:24:13.470
No, just let him hear it.

00:24:14.520 --> 00:24:16.100
We got a call from Iori-san.

00:24:17.630 --> 00:24:19.310
Iori-san, please go ahead.

00:24:23.260 --> 00:24:25.830
Seto-kun, can you hear me?

00:24:25.830 --> 00:24:28.540
I'm sorry that I couldn't be there.

00:24:28.540 --> 00:24:30.750
If I act selfishly,

00:24:30.750 --> 00:24:33.480
I'll cause trouble for a lot of people.

00:24:33.480 --> 00:24:34.410
You understand, right?

00:24:35.780 --> 00:24:41.410
When this play is over, I think I'll quit this job.

00:24:42.780 --> 00:24:46.130
I guess I'm just not cut out for show business.

00:24:46.130 --> 00:24:47.820
There's nothing but pain.

00:24:51.930 --> 00:24:53.990
When I quit this job,

00:24:53.990 --> 00:24:57.200
I'll be with you forever.

00:24:58.760 --> 00:24:59.680
Will that be all right?

00:25:00.140 --> 00:25:03.640
You're really important to me, Seto-kun.

00:25:03.640 --> 00:25:05.140
I can't be without you.

00:25:06.310 --> 00:25:09.770
So please open your eyes, Seto-kun!

00:25:14.650 --> 00:25:16.530
I love you...

00:25:17.550 --> 00:25:18.740
...with all of my heart...

00:25:34.960 --> 00:25:36.050
Hello!

00:25:36.580 --> 00:25:39.280
Oh, thank you for coming, everybody.

00:25:39.280 --> 00:25:41.800
Congratulations!

00:25:41.800 --> 00:25:44.570
Thank you, everyone.

00:25:45.130 --> 00:25:48.120
I appreciate all the help you guys gave us.

00:25:48.120 --> 00:25:50.180
Well, where is Ichitaka?

00:25:50.180 --> 00:25:53.780
He said he had a promise to keep. So, he already left.

00:25:54.650 --> 00:25:55.780
A promise?

00:26:11.060 --> 00:26:14.520
Hi, Icchan! Are you doing well?

00:26:14.520 --> 00:26:17.380
Something really good happened to me today!

00:26:17.380 --> 00:26:21.250
I just had to make a video and tell you!

00:26:21.810 --> 00:26:24.960
Right now, I'm really happy!

00:26:24.960 --> 00:26:27.900
I found a dream that's even more important than sculpting!

00:26:29.080 --> 00:26:31.270
Can you guess?

00:26:31.270 --> 00:26:32.480
Actually...

00:26:34.010 --> 00:26:37.610
...I'm in love! Kya!

00:26:38.590 --> 00:26:40.820
Here's your question!

00:26:40.820 --> 00:26:44.010
What's my new dream?

00:26:44.010 --> 00:26:47.460
Let me give you a hint! It's the same as your dream.

00:26:47.460 --> 00:26:51.950
Perhaps you still haven't figured out what your dream is, Icchan.

00:26:52.770 --> 00:26:53.770
Now that I think about it,

00:26:53.770 --> 00:26:59.990
That dream is what attracted me to a talentless idiot like you in the first place.

00:27:00.810 --> 00:27:06.390
You're always trying so hard to do everything for Iori-san's sake, aren't you?

00:27:06.390 --> 00:27:08.830
Wanting the happiness of the person you love.

00:27:08.830 --> 00:27:12.860
It's the same as wanting to be happy with the one you love, right?

00:27:14.030 --> 00:27:17.370
Not just a dream for yourself, but a dream to wish for others.

00:27:18.090 --> 00:27:20.900
It's not something you can easily find!

00:27:20.900 --> 00:27:23.550
That's why I'm so happy!

00:27:23.550 --> 00:27:25.700
That's how I'm like you, Icchan...

00:27:26.830 --> 00:27:31.240
And now, thanks for sticking with me to the end.

00:27:31.240 --> 00:27:32.380
More to the point...

00:27:32.380 --> 00:27:35.090
...watching this to the end must mean that...

00:27:36.510 --> 00:27:37.590
Seto-kun...

00:28:12.750 --> 00:28:15.130
Congratulations, Icchan!

00:28:15.130 --> 00:28:17.690
You realised your dream!
